{"description": "DSH Tauri 桌面版 | Better DSH desktop, zero environment setup, preset plugins, Windows / macOS / Linux.", "homepage": "https://dshtauri.mintlify.site", "topics": [], "pushed_at": "2026-11-09T04:12:47Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T06:24:02Z", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/320038577?v=4", "license": "MIT", "discussions_total": 3, "latest_release": {"name": "Release v0.31.1", "tag": "v0.31.1", "published_at": "2026-11-07T19:09:09Z", "body": "### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- **macos**: Allow managed core native addons in signed Electron &nbsp;-&nbsp; by @hairyf [<samp>(5d67e)</samp>](https://github.com/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop/commit/5d67e285)\n\n##### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[View changes on GitHub](https://github.com/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop/compare/v0.31.0...v0.31.1)\n\n### 📦 Artifacts\n- **macOS (Apple Silicon)**: 下载 `aarch64.dmg`\n- **macOS (Intel)**: 下载 `x64.dmg`\n- **Windows**: 下载 `.exe`\n- **Linux (x64)**: 下载 `.AppImage` 或 `.deb`（基于 Ubuntu 22.04 构建）\n- **Linux (ARM64)**: 下载 `aarch64.AppImage` 或 `arm64.deb`（基于 Ubuntu 22.04 构建，GLIBC 符号上限 2.35）\n- **Android**: 桌面端发布后追加 `.apk`；未配置签名密钥时使用开发证书，仅供评估\n- **iOS（Testflight）**: 打开 [TestFlight 邀请链接](https://testflight.apple.com/join/kYXkpnp1)，通过 beta 测试安装\n- **iOS（IPA）**: 桌面端发布后追加 `_unsigned.ipa`；需自行签名，不能直接安装\n\n> 文件名带 `_Bundle` 后缀的是**离线捆绑包**：安装包里已内置 Node.js 运行时、pnpm\n> 与打包好的 dsh 内核，首次启动无需联网即可直接运行。不带该后缀的是常规安装包，\n> 首次启动时按需下载运行时依赖。\n"}, "hot_issues": [{"number": 13, "title": "在此征集预设插件", "comments": 12, "created_at": "2026-08-17T01:43:59Z"}, {"number": 1476, "title": "[Bug][Desktop] 模型请求已发出并返回(2.1KB/7KB)仍报 DeepSeek Messages transport failed（0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.2-rc.1）", "comments": 3, "created_at": "2026-11-08T08:22:45Z"}, {"number": 947, "title": "BUG | `会话日志` | 单个巨型会话（日志 188 MB）加载即占约 1.9 GB 堆，8 GB 自动上限下启动任务必然崩溃", "comments": 3, "created_at": "2026-10-07T03:05:48Z"}, {"number": 1210, "title": "BUG | 会话工作区 | 工作区目录被清空且未进回收站，时间上与沙箱授权失败重合", "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:07:32Z"}, {"number": 1108, "title": "BUG | `功能名称` | 插件市场重启异常", "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-10-16T14:02:20Z"}, {"number": 1045, "title": "BUG | `Sandbox` | 请考虑官方白名单化 `~/Library/Caches/org.swift.swiftpm` 目录。", "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:34:33Z"}, {"number": 638, "title": "`功能` | 供应商、模型增加排序", "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-09-21T01:23:30Z"}, {"number": 196, "title": "`功能` | 希望支持在设置页面直接编辑~/.dsh/AGENTS.md", "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-08-28T08:35:35Z"}], "discussions": [{"number": 1357, "title": "[2026-11-03] 关于为什么切换运行时不解在这里做出解答", "comments": 2, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:09:29Z"}, {"number": 688, "title": "88API × DeepSeek Harness Desktop：Provider 与生态合作咨询", "comments": 1, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-09-23T05:16:34Z"}, {"number": 149, "title": "组织新增项目看板：Issues & PRs + Roadmap", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-08-27T05:36:11Z"}], "readme_excerpt": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop\">\n    <img src=\"public/logo.svg\" width=\"96\" alt=\"DeepSeek Harness Tauri Desktop\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">DSH Tauri 桌面版</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  在桌面上运行 <a href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness\">DeepSeek Harness</a> ——<br />\n  无需手动安装 Node.js、pnpm 或 Docker；普通安装首次启动可能需要联网初始化。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Windows\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Windows-blue?style=flat-square&logo=data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" />\n  <img alt=\"MacOS\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-MacOS-black?style=flat-square&logo=apple&logoColor=white\" />\n  <img alt=\"Linux\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Linux-yellow?style=flat-square&logo=linux&logoColor=white\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop/releases\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop?&label=Release&color=4D6BFE\" alt=\"Release\" />\n  </a>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-0.2.1--rc.4-4d6bfe\" alt=\"Recommended DSH 0.2.1-rc.4\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop\" alt=\"MIT License\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop/total?&label=downloads&color=4D6BFE\" alt=\"Downloads\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop?&label=stars&color=4D6BFE\" alt=\"Stars\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop?&label=contributors&color=4D6BFE\" alt=\"Contributors\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/commit-activity/m/dsh-tauri/deepseek-harness-desktop?&label=commits&color=4D6BFE\" alt=\"Commit activity\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <samp><a href=\"https://dshtauri.mintlify.site/zh-CN/installation\">Download</a> · <a href=\"./README.en.md\">English</a> · <a href=\"./README.es.md\">Español</a> · <a href=\"./README.ru.md\">Русский</a> · <a href=\"./README.ko.md\">한국어</a> · <a href=\"https://dshtauri.mintlify.site\">文档</a> · <strong>中文</strong></samp>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://trendshift.io/developers/13307?utm_source=developer-badge&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-developer-13307\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"ht"}}